<title>UK: BOE buys net 4.152 bln stg UK gilts in November.</title>
<headline>BOE buys net 4.152 bln stg UK gilts in November.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England (BOE) bought a net 4.152 billion stg of gilt-edged stock in November after selling a net 4.109 billion in October, BOE statistics showed.</p>
<p> NET PURCHASES OF GILTS (in million stg)   NOV	OCT</p>
<p> Banks (a)				    -2,134    294</p>
<p> Building societies			   -873    482</p>
<p> M4 private sector			  -1,769    319</p>
<p> Overseas					  602  2,861</p>
<p>NOTES - (a) includes discount houses; minus sign denotes net sale; data exclude repurchase transactions with BoE; previously released data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
